  "description": "Do-Yun never got over his childhood tutor, Su-Hyeon, who disappeared without a word years ago. So when they unexpectedly reunite in college as student and professor, Do-Yun thinks he's gotten a second chance at his first love. But Su-Hyeon treats him like a complete stranger, keeping a icy distance. Driven by the sinister rumors surrounding his former tutor, Do-Yun refuses to be pushed away again. If Su-Hyeon won't let him in willingly, Do-Yun will do whatever reckless, unhinged thing it takes to make him look his way.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
